diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index b339829..3e14447 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,9 +1,15 @@
-# Xiaomi SM8550 Sheng common configuration
+# Independent SM8550 common tree for sheng
 
-Sheng-specific SM8550 configuration for AOSPA Calcite. Inherits the separate
-`sm8550-platform-common` tree and uses `vendor/xiaomi/sm8550-sheng-common`.
-Use the pinned manifest and Sheng device README for extraction and builds.
+Derived from the specified Fuxi AOSPA platform/device snapshot, with separate
+paths, vendor extraction module and libinit name. Hardware proprietary files
+are rebased and hash-pinned to official Sheng OS3.0.6.0.WNXMIXM. The original
+Fuxi source is not modified by this work.
 
-The `device/xiaomi/sm8550-platform-common/qspm-v2/provenance.json` records the pinned upstream QSPM input repository.
-Those proprietary binaries are extracted separately and are not relicensed
-under this repository's Apache-2.0 configuration license.
+The included platform patches keep AOSPA source-HAL configuration in its normal
+component evaluation order while using Sheng stock vendor services. System
+multimedia uses AOSPA's AV/WFD stack.
+`proprietary-files.txt` includes the matching Sheng PAL/AGM audio stack.
+Stable NFC/FM HIDL interface libraries use the AOSPA source variants.
+
+See the sheng README for the independent checkout, platform patch and build
+commands. Compilation and hardware validation must be reported separately.
